# Frantic Firebolt ({2}{R}) deals X damage to target creature, "where X is 2 plus the number of cards in your graveyard that are
# instant cards, sorcery cards, and/or have an Adventure" (CR 120.3, 700.2). Bot1's own graveyard holds only the Black Lotus that paid
# for it (an artifact: it is not counted; the Firebolt itself is on the stack, not in the graveyard), and Bot2's graveyard holds a
# Lightning Bolt, an instant, which is not "your graveyard". So X is exactly 2: Bot2's Wall of Earth (0/6) has 2 damage marked. It
# targets a creature only: not a player, nor a noncreature artifact (CR 115.1).

